TI  - Text Enrichment with Japanese Language to Profile Cryptocurrency Influencers
AU  - Lomonaco, F.
AU  - Siino, M.
AU  - Tesconi, M.
T2  - CEUR Workshop Proceedings
A2  - Aliannejadi M.
A2  - Faggioli G.
