TI  - Translate and Classify: Improving Sequence Level Classification for English-Hindi Code-Mixed Data
AU  - Gautam, D.
AU  - Gupta, K.
AU  - Shrivastava, M.
T2  - Computational Approaches to Linguistic Code-Switching, CALCS 2021 - Proceedings of the 5th Workshop
A2  - Solorio T.
